  "/Year": "/Jaar",
  "Buy Now": "Koop nu",
  "View Live Demo": "Bekijk livedemo",
  "Efficient ": "Efficiënt ",
  " Inventory Tracking ": " Voorraad bijhouden ",
  " and Management": " en Beheer",
  "With the Consignment Module, businesses can efficiently track and manage consigned inventory within Dash SaaS. ": "Met de Consignment Module kunnen bedrijven de verzonden voorraad efficiënt volgen en beheren binnen Dash SaaS. ",
  "Viewing and Pricing Products in Consignment": "Producten in consignatie bekijken en prijzen",
  "The Commission Module allows users to view a comprehensive list of products in consignment, ensuring complete visibility over inventory. Additionally, users can manage and update the pricing of these consigned products, which is essential for accurate commission calculations. This feature ensures that all commission-related transactions reflect the most current product prices, maintaining transparency and precision in payouts. You can also add the tax in your consignment while pricing.": "Met de Commissiemodule kunnen gebruikers een uitgebreide lijst met producten in consignatie bekijken, waardoor volledig inzicht in de voorraad wordt gegarandeerd. ",
  "Creating and Converting Purchase Orders": "Inkooporders aanmaken en converteren",
  "In the Commission Module, users can create detailed purchase orders and seamlessly convert these orders into actual purchases. This streamlined process ensures that procurement activities are efficiently managed and that all purchases are accurately recorded for commission calculations. By automating the conversion of purchase orders, the module reduces manual effort and enhances the accuracy of the procurement and commission tracking processes.": "In de Commissiemodule kunnen gebruikers gedetailleerde inkooporders aanmaken en deze bestellingen naadloos omzetten in daadwerkelijke aankopen. ",
  "Creating and Converting Sale Orders": "Verkooporders aanmaken en converteren",
  "The Commission Module also supports the creation of sale orders, which can be easily converted into finalized sales. This functionality is crucial for tracking sales performance and ensuring that commissions are calculated based on completed transactions. By automating the sale order conversion process, the module ensures timely and precise commission payouts, aligning sales": "De Commissiemodule ondersteunt ook het aanmaken van verkooporders, die eenvoudig kunnen worden omgezet in definitieve verkopen. ",
